---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy | Consultant Client Ops" description="Refund policy for Consultant Client Ops digital products.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 prose-doc">
    <h1 class="text-4xl mb-6">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: July 7, 2026</p>

    <h2>Digital products</h2>
    <p>Because our products are instantly downloadable digital files, we ask you to review the free preview content on each product's page before purchasing. If a product genuinely doesn't fit your use case, contact us within 14 days of purchase with your Gumroad order number and we'll issue a refund.</p>

    <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
    <p>Reply to your Gumroad purchase confirmation email, or use the contact link on your Gumroad receipt, with your order number and a short note on what didn't work for you. We review every request individually.</p>

    <h2>What isn't covered</h2>
    <p>Refund requests made after the 14-day window, or for reasons unrelated to the product itself (e.g. change of mind after extensive use of the files), are handled at our discretion.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
